\paragraph{Operator-level compression.} DiTFastAttn addresses spatial, temporal and conditional redundancy in self-attention by replacing global attention with windowed kernels and sharing results across steps \cite{yuan-2024-ditfastattn}. Streamlined Inference partitions features and groups operators to lower memory and latency \cite{zhan-2024-fast}. Both modify the computation graph, whereas TA--FJLT--Cache is an orthogonal content-adaptive encoding layer that requires no kernel fusion or model patching.  
                                                                                                                                                                                                                 ^
