\paragraph{Assumptions and trade-offs.} Learned projectors or routers introduce parameters that must be stored and sometimes fine-tuned \cite{ma-2024-learning}; attention compression often assumes specific block structures \cite{yuan-2024-ditfastattn}; distillation requires access to training data \cite{salimans-2024-multistep}. TA--FJLT--Cache is training-free, stores no additional weights, depends only on sampler-supplied $\sigma_t^2$ values and uniquely exploits a second temporal dimension in video caches, a direction untouched by prior work.  
                                                                                                                                       ^
